{"root":{"data":{"id":"dl2wr49xb4w0","created":1788156997760,"text":"终端助手"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2wrbrjleo0","created":1788157014063,"text":"LLM对话/引擎","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-27.999999165534973,"y":-15.999999523162899}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2wrlh2nhs0","created":1788157035198,"text":"多轮对话"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2wrrgqerc0","created":1788157048238,"text":"历史压缩","layout_right_offset":{"x":0.9999999701976776,"y":37.99999886751175}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2wrx2jzbs0","created":1788157060441,"text":"实现","layout_right_offset":{"x":18.999999433755875,"y":-70.99999788403508}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2wrtkz1hc0","created":1788157052848,"text":"流式更新"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2ws5zny940","created":1788157079858,"text":"消息模型"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2ws8bpqxs0","created":1788157084940,"text":"token计数"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2ws44jgxs0","created":1788157075799,"text":"工具调用"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2yl7eg7w80","created":1788162176599,"text":"工具描述","note":"功能、场景、约束、返回格式、配合建议"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2ynpbd8340","created":1788162372323,"text":"工具接口"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2za70wwtc0","created":1788164134885,"text":"串行/并行调用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zza52wkg0","created":1788166100771,"text":"MCP"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl300ofc9zc0","created":1788166210231,"text":"协议层次","note":"Data Layer\nTransport Layer"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl301gfnif40","created":1788166271199,"text":"原语","note":"Tools\nResources\nPrompts"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2wrhmy3j40","created":1788157026846,"text":"AI辅助开发","layout_mind_offset":{"x":-49.99999850988377,"y":-418.9999940991403}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2z0x8pjtk0","created":1788163408311,"text":"Agent Loop","note":"循环：将模型回复的信息和工具调用的结果放在历史messages中，再次调用"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2z7kgazhs0","created":1788163929021,"text":"产生Loop","note":"循环：将模型回复的信息和工具调用的结果放在历史messages中，再次调用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2z7qc6bv40","created":1788163941832,"text":"停止","expandState":"collapse"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2z7t6riyw0","created":1788163948035,"text":"没有工具调用"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2z7yfmlfc0","created":1788163959455,"text":"迭代上限"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2z80sjb080","created":1788163964589,"text":"用户取消"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2z8c273ns0","created":1788163989118,"text":"异常状态检测"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2z9322ico0","created":1788164047883,"text":"AgentEvent"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2znq6x04o0","created":1788165195341,"text":"权限防御"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2zqn9vnxc0","created":1788165424082,"text":"威胁模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2zqpvtnl40","created":1788165429762,"text":"prompt注入","note":"模型读取了一个看似普通的文件，但文件里藏着恶意指令。这种攻击的阴险之处在于：攻击者不需要直接接触你的 Agent，只需要在 Agent 可能读到的任何地方（代码注释、文档、配置文件、甚至是错误信息）植入诱导性文本。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zss5r0mo0","created":1788165591445,"text":"越权操作","note":"用户说「帮我修一下这个 bug」。Agent 在修 bug 的过程中觉得「 这个项目结构不太合理，我顺手重构一下吧 」，于是移动了十几个文件，改了构建脚本，甚至更新了 CI 配置。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zsuq3vp40","created":1788165597029,"text":"数据泄露","note":"Agent 读了一个 .env 文件，里面有 API Key 和数据库密码。然后它在回复里引用了这些内容：「我发现你的数据库密码是 xxx，这个密码强度不够建议修改。」如果对话内容被日志记录或发送到第三方服务，敏感信息就泄露了。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zu88kneo0","created":1788165704808,"text":"多层防御"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl2zuch0pz40","created":1788165714026,"text":"黑名单","note":"rm mkfs"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zue8xd1c0","created":1788165717890,"text":"沙箱","note":"沙箱默认允许两个目录： 项目根目录 和 系统临时目录 "},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zugw686o0","created":1788165723649,"text":"规则"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zuje3vpk0","created":1788165729087,"text":"整体策略"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl2zumld9ds0","created":1788165736057,"text":"HITL确认"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl3044gj7og0","created":1788166480224,"text":"上下文管理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl304zo0q0g0","created":1788166548157,"text":"压缩","note":"1、大结果存磁盘，对话里放路径\n2、摘要旧消息、保留近期原文（Auto-Compact）\n\t触发：预留20k摘要输出和13k的抖动余量"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl30css48jk0","created":1788167160081,"text":"记忆管理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl30dx0wck80","created":1788167247683,"text":"记忆类型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl30dzozbww0","created":1788167253492,"text":"用户偏好"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl30e1wqgpk0","created":1788167258315,"text":"纠正反馈"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl30e4kgx1s0","created":1788167264103,"text":"项目知识"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl30e89jgqg0","created":1788167272150,"text":"参考信息"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl33nw84vlk0","created":1788176492915,"text":"过期会话清理"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl348i21z200","created":1788178107720,"text":"slash"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl34be86qsg0","created":1788178334476,"text":"注册"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl34bfopymw0","created":1788178337652,"text":"解析"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl34bhktae80","created":1788178341770,"text":"执行"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl34jyanyg80","created":1788179005075,"text":"skill"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl34njs5tj40","created":1788179286937,"text":"执行模式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl34nnwnluo0","created":1788179295916,"text":"inline 共享"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl34npj878o0","created":1788179299458,"text":"fork 隔离"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl354us9g800","created":1788180643079,"text":"Hook"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl354xgi0z40","created":1788180648898,"text":"要素"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dl35529zejs0","created":1788180659388,"text":"事件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl3553ze3jk0","created":1788180663101,"text":"条件"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dl3555q00jk0","created":1788180666887,"text":"动作"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dl3550c1nsw0","created":1788180655159,"text":"Agent事件"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}